 "description": "AWG wire properties (ASTM B258) and round-trip voltage drop for a copper pair: diameter, area, loop resistance (2\u00d7 length, go & return), drop %, and a PASS/WARNING/FAIL verdict (<3% / 3-5% / >5%).\n\nArgs: awg (e.g. 20), supply_v, current_a, length_m (one-way), temp_c (default 20).\nReturns (structured): { diameter_mm, area_mm2, loop_resistance_ohm, voltage_drop_v, drop_percent, verdict }.\nExample: AWG20, 5 V, 2 A, 1 m -> 0.067 \u03a9 loop, 2.7% drop, PASS.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
